namespace UObjectToolTips

UISlider:bControllerCaptured {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UISlider.h#UISlider:bControllerCaptured
    src   "Whether the gamepad currently holds this slider. Transient: a capture is a live gesture."
    text  "手柄当前是否持有此滑块。瞬态：捕获是一次实时手势。"
    state machine
}

UISlider:bLocked {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UISlider.h#UISlider:bLocked
    src   "Shows its value and refuses to be moved -- UMG's Locked.\n\nA different thing from not being interactable, which is why it is a flag of its own: a\ndisabled slider is drawn in its Disabled colours and says \"not now\", a locked one looks\ncompletely ordinary and says \"this is what it is\". A volume bar during a cutscene is the\nsecond thing, not the first.\n\nIt gates INPUT only. SetValue keeps working, because a read-only slider that game code could\nnot write would have nothing to show."
    text  "显示其值并拒绝被移动——即 UMG 的 Locked。\n\n这与不可交互是两回事，因此它自成一个标志：\n禁用的滑块以其 Disabled 颜色绘制，说的是“现在不行”；锁定的滑块看起来\n完全普通，说的是“它本来就是这样”。过场动画中的音量条属于\n后者，而非前者。\n\n它只拦截输入。SetValue 仍然有效，因为一个游戏代码无法\n写入的只读滑块将无从显示。"
    state machine
}

UISlider:bMouseCaptured {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UISlider.h#UISlider:bMouseCaptured
    src   "Whether the pointer press being handled began a mouse capture -- SSlider's HasMouseCapture. Set\nby a press on an unlocked slider and cleared by the release that ends it, which is what keeps\nOnMouseCaptureBegin and OnMouseCaptureEnd in pairs: a press on a locked slider begins nothing,\nso its release ends nothing, and a lock that lands mid-drag still ends the capture already begun."
    text  "正在处理的指针按下是否开启了一次鼠标捕获——即 SSlider 的 HasMouseCapture。由对未锁定滑块的按下设置，\n并由结束它的释放清除，这使 OnMouseCaptureBegin 与 OnMouseCaptureEnd 始终成对：对锁定滑块的按下不开启任何捕获，\n因此其释放也不结束任何捕获；而在拖动过程中生效的锁定\n仍会结束已经开始的捕获。"
    state machine
}

