UISlider:MouseUsesStep {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UISlider.h#UISlider:MouseUsesStep
    src   "Quantise a mouse drag to StepSize. Off, a drag is continuous -- which is this library's default."
    text  "将鼠标拖动按 StepSize 量化。关闭时拖动是连续的——这是本库的默认值。"
    state machine
}

UISlider:NavigationChangeInterval {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UISlider.h#UISlider:NavigationChangeInterval
    src   "When use navigation input to change the slider value, each press will change value as (MaxValue - MinValue) * NavigationChangeInterval."
    text  "使用导航输入更改滑块值时，每次按键将按 (MaxValue - MinValue) * NavigationChangeInterval 更改值。"
    state machine
}

UISlider:RequiresControllerLock {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UISlider.h#UISlider:RequiresControllerLock
    src   "A gamepad must CAPTURE this slider before its directions move the value -- UMG's\nRequiresControllerLock, and on for the same reason it is on there: a row of sliders the stick\nmoves THROUGH is unusable if the first slider swallows every left and right.\n\nThe capture is taken and released by the navigation TRIGGER (the key a focused control is\nactivated with), which arrives here as a pointer down carrying InputType Navigation. While\ncaptured the directions change the value; while not, they fall through to the navigation\nsearch and move focus to the next control."
    text  "游戏手柄必须先 CAPTURE 此滑块，其方向才会改变值——即 UMG 的\nRequiresControllerLock，开启它的原因与那里相同：如果第一个滑块吞掉所有左右输入，\n摇杆所穿过的一排滑块就无法使用。\n\n捕获由导航 TRIGGER（激活焦点控件所用的按键）获取和释放，\n该触发在此以携带 InputType Navigation 的指针按下形式到达。捕获期间，\n方向会改变值；未捕获时，方向会落入导航搜索，\n将焦点移到下一个控件。"
    state machine
}

UISlider:SetControllerCaptured {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UISlider.h#UISlider:SetControllerCaptured
    src   "The one writer of the capture flag, so the flag and the two events can never disagree."
    text  "捕获标志的唯一写入者，因此该标志与两个事件永远不会不一致。"
    state machine
}

UISlider:SetFill {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UISlider.h#UISlider:SetFill
    src   "The parts and the direction, settable from code. All three properties are EditAnywhere, so the\ndesigner and .dui have always reached them by reflection while no caller could -- the same hole\nUUIToggle's transition target had. Each resets the cached area and re-applies, the way\nPostEditChangeProperty already does for an edit."
    text  "部件与方向，可从代码设置。这三个属性都是 EditAnywhere，所以\n设计器和 .dui 一直通过反射访问它们，而没有任何调用方能够做到——这与\nUUIToggle 的过渡目标曾经的漏洞相同。每次设置都会重置缓存的区域并重新应用，正如\nPostEditChangeProperty 对编辑所做的那样。"
    state machine
}

UISlider:SetMaxValue {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UISlider.h#UISlider:SetMaxValue
    src   "@param       InMaxValue                      New value set for MaxValue\n@param       KeepRelativeValue       Keep percentage value, eg: if origin value is 0.25 from 0.0 to 1.0, then it will be 25.0 from 0.0 to 100.0, or be -7.5 from -10.0 to 0.0\n@param       FireEvent                       Should execute callback event?"
    text  "@param       InMaxValue                      MaxValue 的新值\n@param       KeepRelativeValue       保持百分比值，例如：若原值为 0.0 到 1.0 范围内的 0.25，则它将变为 0.0 到 100.0 范围内的 25.0，或 -10.0 到 0.0 范围内的 -7.5\n@param       FireEvent                       是否执行回调事件？"
    state machine
}

