UISlider:SetWholeNumbers {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UISlider.h#UISlider:SetWholeNumbers
    src   "Settable, like the parts and the direction beside it and for the same reason: the property is\nEditAnywhere, so the designer and .dui have always reached it by reflection while no caller\ncould -- and a slider assembled in code (every UDreamSlider) is exactly such a caller.\n\nTurning it ON snaps the value it is holding, because a whole-number slider showing 2.5 is a\ncontrol disagreeing with its own rule."
    text  "可设置，与旁边的部件和方向一样，原因也相同：该属性是\nEditAnywhere，所以设计器和 .dui 一直通过反射访问它，而没有任何调用方\n能够做到——而在代码中组装的滑块（每个 UDreamSlider）正是这样的调用方。\n\n开启它会将当前持有的值对齐到整数，因为显示 2.5 的整数滑块是一个\n与自身规则相矛盾的控件。"
    state machine
}

UISlider:StepSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UISlider.h#UISlider:StepSize
    src   "The quantum a MOUSE drag moves the value in, while MouseUsesStep is on -- UMG's StepSize.\n\nDeliberately NOT the keyboard's: this library already states the navigation step as\nNavigationChangeInterval, a FRACTION of the range, and every slider authored against this\nplugin means that number when it says \"one press\". Re-pointing navigation at StepSize would\nsilently re-scale every one of them, so the two live side by side and each says which input it\ngoverns. StepSize is an ABSOLUTE value step; NavigationChangeInterval is a fraction."
    text  "MouseUsesStep 开启时，鼠标拖拽移动值的量——即 UMG 的 StepSize。\n\n有意不用作键盘的步长：本库已将导航步长定义为\nNavigationChangeInterval，即范围的一个比例值，而针对此插件制作的每个滑块\n在说“一次按键”时指的都是那个数字。将导航改为指向 StepSize 会\n悄无声息地重新缩放所有这些滑块，因此两者并存，各自说明自己管辖哪种输入。\nStepSize 是绝对值步长；NavigationChangeInterval 是比例值。"
    state machine
}

UISlider:WholeNumbers {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UISlider.h#UISlider:WholeNumbers
    src   "Whole numbers only: every value the slider takes -- dragged, stepped by navigation, set or authored --\nis rounded to the nearest whole number, so each one owns an equal stretch of the track."
    text  "仅限整数：滑块接收的每个值——拖拽、通过导航步进、设置或编辑——\n都会舍入到最接近的整数，因此每个值在轨道上占据相同的一段。"
    state machine
}
